# Pipeline contracts

When changing ingestion, models, analysis JSON, routes context, or templates:

1. Check `.cursor/resources/pipeline-contract.md`
2. Preserve Bill natural key `(congress, bill_type, bill_number)` + `active`
3. Prefer `AIAnalysis` / `Summary` tables over legacy `Bill.ai_analysis`
4. Keep `display_ready` semantics (see display-ready contract)
5. Emit a handoff naming every downstream owner

Category extraction must keep supporting `categories`, `category_breakdown`, and `primary_category` / `secondary_categories` formats unless all writers and readers are updated together.
